        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Vipsania Agrippina, most commonly known as Agrippina Major or Agrippina the Elder (14 BC – 17 October 33), was was the wife of the general and statesman Germanicus. She was granddaughter of Augustus, mother of Caligula, second cousin of Claudius and grandmother of Nero.</skos:definition>
