        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ru">Антония Младшая</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Antonia Minor, also known as Antonia the Younger or simply Antonia (31 January 36 BC - September/October AD 37) was the daughter of Mark Antony and Octavia Minor. She was a niece of Augustus, sister-in-law of the Emperor Tiberius, grandmother of Caligula and Agrippina the Younger, mother of the Emperor Claudius, and both great-grandmother and great-aunt of the Emperor Nero.</skos:definition>
