        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="es">Clodio Albino</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Decimus Clodius Albinus (c. 150 – 19 February 197) was a Roman general, senator and usurper who claimed the imperial title several times between 193 and 197.</skos:definition>
