        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Constantine II</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Constantine II (Flavius Claudius Constantinus) was Roman emperor from 337 to 340. Son of Constantine the Great and co-emperor alongside his brothers, his attempt to exert his perceived rights of primogeniture led to his death in a failed invasion of Italy in 340.</skos:definition>
