        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="nl">Flavia Domitilla maior</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Flavia Domitilla Major, Flavia Domitilla the Elder or Domitilla the Elder (died before 69, perhaps c. 65) was the wife of the Roman Emperor Vespasian. She was the mother of Domitilla the Younger and of the emperors Titus and Domitian.</skos:definition>
