        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Flavius Victor</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Flavius Victor was a Western Roman emperor from either 383/384 or 387 to August 388, recognized as a legitimate emperor by Theodosius I. He was the son of Magnus Maximus, and co-ruler.</skos:definition>
