        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Marcus F. Ru. Jotapianus (died c. 249) or Jotapian, also known as Iotapianus or Iotapian, was a usurper in the eastern provinces of the Roman Empire during the reign of Emperor Philip the Arab, around 249.</skos:definition>
