        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Jovinus</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Jovinus was a Gallo-Roman senator and claimed to be Roman Emperor (411–413 AD) and co-ruled Gaul with his brother, Sebastianus.</skos:definition>
