      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Moneta</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Juno Moneta, an epithet of Juno, was the protectress of funds, and, accordingly, money in ancient Rome was coined in her temple.</skos:definition>
