        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Liber</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">In ancient Roman religion and mythology, Liber, also known as Liber Pater ("the free Father"), was a god of viticulture and wine, fertility and freedom.</skos:definition>
