        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Maximinus Daia</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Maximinus Daia[a] (Galerius Valerius Maximinus) was Roman emperor from 310 to 313. He became embroiled in the Civil wars of the Tetrarchy between rival claimants for control of the empire, in which he was defeated by Licinius.</skos:definition>
