        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Valeria Messalina, sometimes spelled Messallina, (c. 17/20–48) was the third wife of the Emperor Claudius. She was also a cousin of Nero, second cousin of Caligula, and great-grandniece of Augustus.</skos:definition>
