        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Priscus Attalus</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Priscus Attalus (d. after 416) was twice Roman usurper (in 409-10 and in 414-15), against Emperor Honorius, with Visigothic support. He was the last non-Christian Roman emperor.</skos:definition>
