        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Valentinian III</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Valentinian III (Flavius Placidius Valentinianus), son of Constantius III and Galla Placidia, was Roman emperor of the West from 425 to 455. His reign was marked by the ongoing collapse of the Western Empire.</skos:definition>
