        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Vesta</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Vesta is the virgin goddess of the hearth, home, and family in Roman religion. She was rarely depicted in human form, and was often represented by the fire of her temple in the Forum Romanum.</skos:definition>
